## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical expertise in multi-tenant governance, deployment automation, and Azure-native patterns like Lighthouse, RBAC scoping, Private Link, and centralized monitoring.

## Key Concepts
- Azure Lighthouse for cross-tenant delegation
- Management Groups/subscriptions per tenant pattern
- Least-privilege RBAC scoped to resource groups
- Private Endpoint / Private Link to shared services
- Azure Policy for tagging and governance; per-tenant budgets
- Centralized monitoring via a single Azure Monitor workspace

## Code Example
```javascript
param tenantName string
param location string = resourceGroup().location
param sqlDatabaseId string

resource tenantRG 'Microsoft.Resources/resourceGroups@2021-04-01' = {
  name: 'rg-${tenantName}'
  location: location
}

resource privateEndpoint 'Microsoft.Network/privateEndpoints@2022-07-01' = {
  name: 'pe-${tenantName}-sql'
  location: location
  resourceGroup: tenantRG.name
  properties: {
    subnet: {
      id: subnetId
    }
    privateLinkServiceConnections: [{
      name: 'sql-connection'
      properties: {
        privateLinkServiceId: sqlDatabaseId
        groupIds: ['sqlServer']
      }
    }]
  }
}
```

## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design multi-tenant real-time analytics on Azure with data isolation, security, DR, governance, and CI/CD. Combines streaming, storage, analytics, API security, and cross-region considerations.

## Key Concepts

- Event Hubs, Durable Functions, Function Apps
- Azure Data Lake Storage Gen2, Synapse, Row-Level Security
- API Management, Azure Entra ID, per-tenant RBAC
- Private Link for back-end service access
- Azure Policy, Cost Management budgets
- Cross-region DR, event replay, API failover

## Code Example

```javascript
// Skeleton: orchestration with per-tenant workflow (pseudo)
import { orchestrator } from 'durable-functions';
export const runFraudWorkflow = orchestrator(function*(context) {
  const event = context.bindings.input;
  yield context.df.callActivity('ValidateEvent', event);
});
```

